{"reviewId": "33139031_833wskx3h", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "周金涛的观点是中周期高点后 5-10 年出现房地产大底，据此推测，由于美国已现（2025 年中）中周期高点，其房地产大底会在 2030-2035 年。中国这一轮朱格拉周期投资的新三样“新能源汽车（EV）、锂电池、光伏”，光伏在 2023 年尤其前期投资过热而过剩，电动车 2025 年过剩，现在政府正在通过反内卷、供给侧改革来去产能，也已经过了中周期高点，其房地产周期大底在 2028 年-2032 年左右出现。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "15398-15485", "abstract": "(5)房地产周期的低点大致会滞后于中周期低点，由于2019—2020年可能是美国中周期低点，因此本轮房地产周期的终极大底可能出现在2020年之后，即在2020—2025年见底", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 17, "chapterName": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "chapterIdx": 17, "reviewId": "33139031_833wskx3h", "userVid": 33139031, "topics": [], "createTime": 1757485824, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 33139031, "name": "东吾", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLibGd6PD4BQOAzic7tWmjR3qllDaOF6JjTK7jBuL4hDDCvMpdHMpruIj7dELFZnjFJIJ5icBqO50jFQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 32, "likes": [{"userVid": 57969848, "name": "旋律", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/xhBPJhLcrn6r0qY82dAqUyV1ERexyhZILMx7ehPlP5CDFozEQlsUrC3AyqQWzdxhVR98wARiaLdMol2cbw6HVOQzFkPBkqdNP0TMM6PribRv0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "小牛马", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}],